(    Tangkhul Verses:) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(      "Hao pheichakli pheikao kazing,") Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(      "Longpi rammayong wui khangara.") Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(      "Kashan kuiphop aina ngathatta,") Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(      "Kaphung kachungli khangaso laa.") Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(    English Gloss:) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(      "In the ceremonial circle of Hao Pheichak, the rhythmic footwork echoes,") Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(      "The valiant defenders and sons of Longpi village step forth.") Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(      "Adorned in ceremonial headgear and traditional woven shawls,") Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(      "Their anthems of bravery resound through the mountain ridges.") Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 8 Tf
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
